{
  "key": 58407,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} examined the ancient\n",
        "cave painting.\r",
        "Mysterious designs cover a whole\n",
        "section of the wall.\r",
        "There are three strange things\n",
        "forming a triangle.\r",
        "In the middle of them, a shining\n",
        "sphere?\r",
        "What is this all about?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "The cave painting’s meaning seems\n",
        "to be this...\r",
        "There existed beings...\r",
        "Beings so powerful, they were\n",
        "considered deities at the time.\r",
        "There were three Pokémon with power\n",
        "to match either being.\r",
        "The three kept balance with either\n",
        "being, as if they formed a pyramid.\r",
        "It’s an ancient legend of Sinnoh\n",
        "that is still told in Celestic Town.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "???: I would like to know more about\n",
        "that legend, if you will.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00003",
      "en_US": "Elder: Who might you be...?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "My name is Cyrus.\r",
        "I want to put an end to pointless\n",
        "strife and hostility.\r",
        "I am seeking the power to create the\n",
        "ideal world.\r",
        "Thus, I want you to answer.\r",
        "The world today can’t change because\n",
        "the three Pokémon keep it in balance.\r",
        "Is that what you are saying?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: I wouldn’t know.\n",
        "I do know the world is in balance.\r",
        "I’m quite satisfied with the world the\n",
        "way it is.\r",
        "I’m not interested in your question.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...Plead ignorance, will you?\n",
        "What a pointless attitude.\r",
        "You fail to appreciate that the world\n",
        "is incomplete.\r",
        "I will change the world.\r",
        "As the first step, I will destroy this\n",
        "cave painting that you’ve protected\f",
        "all these years.\r",
        "A new legend of a new world should\n",
        "take its place.\r",
        "Am I wrong?\n",
        "If you feel that way, challenge me.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Well? Am I wrong?\n",
        "If you feel that way, challenge me.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...I know you, Trainer.\n",
        "We’ve met at Mt. Coronet.\r",
        "Why would you want to protect this\n",
        "incomplete world?\r",
        "As the boss of Team Galactic, I will\n",
        "show you the error of your ways.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...You chose to be a coward.\n",
        "How sensible of you.\r",
        "Stand aside and watch as I change\n",
        "the world."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...You chose to be a coward.\n",
        "How sensible of you.\r",
        "Stand aside and watch as I change\n",
        "the world.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...Remarkable.\r",
        "But, Elder, your attitude told me what\n",
        "I needed to know.\r",
        "If the beings of time and space are\n",
        "brought together, they can’t be\f",
        "stopped...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "That cave painting isn’t protected\n",
        "simply because it’s old.\r",
        "We’ve preserved it because we value\n",
        "the memories that it represents.\r",
        "It is a legacy of people and Pokémon\n",
        "beyond measure.\r",
        "A man who fails to understand that...\n",
        "What world could he dream of?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Such a strange, strange man.\n",
        "Spouting such nonsense.\r",
        "The time and space of Sinnoh are\n",
        "filled with the memories and thoughts\f",
        "of countless people and Pokémon.\r",
        "This is a wonderful world.\n",
        "What need is there to change it?\r",
        "Oh, yes. I found something useful.\n",
        "You should take this.\r",
        "It belonged to my granddaughter,\n",
        "but she doesn’t use it anymore.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "If a Pokémon learns Surf, it can\n",
        "carry you across water and the sea.\r",
        "You’ve been a great help.\n",
        "That’s my thanks for it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} examined the ancient\n",
        "cave painting.\r",
        "Mysterious designs cover a whole\n",
        "section of the wall.\r",
        "There are three strange things forming\n",
        "a triangle.\r",
        "In the middle of them, a shining\n",
        "sphere..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This cave painting...\n",
        "It’s always been described this way.\r",
        "The light in the center represents\n",
        "either DIALGA or PALKIA appearing\f",
        "at the Spear Pillar.\r",
        "The three lights around it were thought\n",
        "to be UXIE, MESPRIT, and AZELF.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00017",
      "en_US": "May I continue?"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: But, then, I realized that\n",
        "there may be another way of\f",
        "interpreting this.\r",
        "Could this triangle of lights actually\n",
        "represent a different trio?\r",
        "Could they be DIALGA, PALKIA, and\n",
        "GIRATINA instead?\r",
        "And the large light at their center.\n",
        "Does it represent something else?\r",
        "Could it be what created this world of\n",
        "ours?\r",
        "May I continue for a little bit longer?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Thank you for listening to\n",
        "my theory.\r",
        "Do you know of the ancient Plates they\n",
        "find all over Sinnoh?\r",
        "One of them had this engraved on it.\r",
        "“Two beings of time and space set\n",
        "free from the Original One.”\r",
        "I think this quote, too, points to the\n",
        "presence of another Pokémon.\r",
        "A Pokémon even more powerful than\n",
        "DIALGA or PALKIA.\r",
        "Does that sound plausible to you?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m not quite sure how GIRATINA fits\n",
        "into this scheme of things, but...\r",
        "It’s said that in the Distortion World,\n",
        "neither time nor space were stable.\r",
        "I think that tells us something about\n",
        "GIRATINA, the only Pokémon there.\r",
        "It must have been as powerful as\n",
        "DIALGA and PALKIA, the rulers of time\f",
        "and space.\r",
        "In some way, though, GIRATINA has to\n",
        "have a power opposite of theirs.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry this is so long.\n",
        "May I say one last bit?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "A long time ago, I wonder what sort of\n",
        "person painted this?\r",
        "DIALGA’s Roar of Time...\n",
        "PALKIA’s Spacial Rend...\r",
        "To the people back then, those Pokémon\n",
        "really must have appeared to rule\f",
        "over time and space.\r",
        "Seeing them must have shaken the\n",
        "people to their very core.\r",
        "This painting represents those feelings\n",
        "of awe, wonder, and everything else.\r",
        "It passed that memory to countless\n",
        "people, eventually becoming a myth...\r",
        "That’s what I believe as a researcher\n",
        "of myths.\r",
        "I think I let myself get carried away\n",
        "and talked for far too long.\r",
        "I’m sorry, and thank you.\n",
        "Let’s meet again.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000589_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m so sorry.\n",
        "I let myself get carried away...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2RowanThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Thank you for seeing us,\n",
        "elder.\r",
        "These are the two I told you\n",
        "about.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderChildren",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: The children who went into\n",
        "the torn world. And came back.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderSit",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: Sit. Old women tell stories.\n",
        "Sometimes the stories are true.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderThree",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: Each age, someone bends time\n",
        "to undo a grief, and makes more.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderListen",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: I know three such stories.\n",
        "Listen.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderKing",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: A king stopped the clock on\n",
        "the last morning his queen breathed.\r",
        "His kingdom stood frozen in that\n",
        "morning for a hundred years.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderSailor",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: A sailor folded the sea to\n",
        "find the world where his partner\r",
        "never drowned.\r",
        "He found it. He could never find\n",
        "his way home.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderSister",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: A sister kept watch at a gate\n",
        "for her brother.\r",
        "She kept everyone else out, too.\r",
        "Until there was no one left to\n",
        "let in.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderBeneath",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: Each time, something rose\n",
        "from beneath the world.\r",
        "And set it right. Never gently.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2CyrusEveryTime",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...Every time?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderEveryTimeIKnow",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: Every time I know of.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2SarosRespect",
      "en_US": [
        "Saros: With respect, elder, that's\n",
        "what people say once they've made\r",
        "their peace with losing.\r",
        "Some of us haven't.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2GariusOldStories",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Yeah. Old stories.\r",
        "It's easy to tell people to let go\n",
        "when you've never lost anything.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderWhatLost",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: Child. What have you lost?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2GariusNothing",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Nothing. Forget it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2SarosSharp",
      "en_US": [
        "Saros: You're sharp.\r",
        "Team Eclipse could use people like\n",
        "you.\r",
        "...You're the Twinleaf boy.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2GariusNotInterested",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Not interested.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2RowanQuestion",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Elder. One question. As a\n",
        "scientist, if you'll allow it.\r",
        "Can the dead come back?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderCost",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: The stories never say they\n",
        "can't.\r",
        "They say what it costs.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2RowanSayingNo",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: ...I've spent my life saying\n",
        "no.\r",
        "I'm not sure I can anymore.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2GariusHuh",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Huh.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2GariusVeilstone",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I'm off to Veilstone.\n",
        "Third badge. Don't wait up.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2RuthVeilstone",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: I'll go on ahead to Veilstone,\n",
        "too. Maylene wants my readings.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2RowanGoOn",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Go on. I'll stay and talk\n",
        "with the elder a while.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2RowanGoOnRepeat",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Go on. I'll stay and talk\n",
        "with the elder a while."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderBeneathRepeat",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: Each time, something rose\n",
        "from beneath the world.\r",
        "And set it right. Never gently."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2RuthWhoWasThat",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Who WAS that?\r",
        "...How did he know we'd be here?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2ElderYesterday",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: He came yesterday. Asked the\n",
        "same questions you will.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownCave_Text_Arc2RowanEclipse",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Eclipse. One of the three who\n",
        "run it, I'd wager.\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
